# Default measurement-server URL baked in at build time.
# The app can override this at runtime in ตั้งค่า → เซิร์ฟเวอร์ประมวลผล, which is
# what you want with a Cloudflare quick tunnel: its hostname changes on every
# restart, and a rebuild per restart is not workable. With a reserved ngrok
# domain the hostname is stable, so setting it here is fine.
# Leave empty to ship in demo mode (simulated figures).
VITE_API_URL=

# API token for the write endpoints.
#
# ⚠️ Anything VITE_ is compiled into the JavaScript the browser downloads. Set
# this and the token is readable by anyone who opens the bundle — it is not a
# secret any more, and the protection it was added for (a stranger finding the
# tunnel URL and filling the disk) is mostly gone. It still costs an attacker a
# deliberate look rather than a stray request, but no more than that.
#
# Prefer leaving it empty and typing the token into ตั้งค่า on each phone: a PoC
# runs on a handful of known devices, and localStorage keeps it off the wire.
VITE_API_TOKEN=

# LIFF ID — เปิดแอปในไลน์แล้วดึงชื่อ/รูปจาก LINE profile อัตโนมัติ
# ต้องใส่ใน Vercel ด้วย ไม่งั้นเวอร์ชันที่ deploy จะไม่รู้จัก LIFF
# ปล่อยว่าง = ทำงานเป็นเว็บปกติ กรอกฟอร์มเอง
VITE_LIFF_ID=
